# FlintTrade — site

This package contains the FlintTrade documentation site.

## Scope
- Next.js app routes, Fumadocs content plumbing, MCP docs endpoints, and site shell.
- Shared UI comes from `@flinttrade/design-system`.
- Trading terminal widgets stay in `packages/apps/terminal`.

## Checks
- Run `npm run build` in this package for site-facing changes.
